<h3 id="mode-values" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Mode Values</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#mode-values" aria-label="Link to Mode Values"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Mode</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>normal</code></td><td>Standard vacuum, reclaims dead tuples</td></tr><tr><td><code>aggressive</code></td><td>Scans all pages to advance relfrozenxid, not just those with dead tuples</td></tr><tr><td><code>failsafe</code></td><td>Emergency mode triggered when the database is close to transaction ID wraparound</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h3 id="started-by-values" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Started By Values</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#started-by-values" aria-label="Link to Started By Values"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Value</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>auto</code></td><td>Triggered by the autovacuum launcher</td></tr><tr><td><code>manual</code></td><td>Explicitly run by a user (VACUUM command)</td></tr><tr><td><code>wraparound</code></td><td>Triggered by the autovacuum launcher specifically to prevent wraparound</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>This is useful for understanding why vacuum is consuming resources. A <code>wraparound</code> vacuum in <code>aggressive</code> mode will scan the entire table regardless of dead tuple count, which can cause I/O spikes.</p>
<h2 id="per-process-type-log-levels" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Per-Process-Type Log Levels</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#per-process-type-log-levels" aria-label="Link to Per-Process-Type Log Levels"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>The <code>log_min_messages</code> parameter now accepts a comma-separated list of process-type overrides:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span># postgresql.conf</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span>log_min_messages = &#x27;warning, autovacuum:debug1, archiver:debug5&#x27;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>This sets the default log level to <code>warning</code> but enables debug logging for autovacuum and archiver processes specifically.</p>
<h3 id="supported-process-types" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Supported Process Types</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#supported-process-types" aria-label="Link to Supported Process Types"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>The 14 supported process types include:</p>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Process Type</th><th>Typical Use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>autovacuum</code></td><td>Debug vacuum behavior without flooding logs with backend messages</td></tr><tr><td><code>archiver</code></td><td>Troubleshoot WAL archiving issues</td></tr><tr><td><code>checkpointer</code></td><td>Investigate checkpoint timing and I/O</td></tr><tr><td><code>walsender</code></td><td>Debug replication issues</td></tr><tr><td><code>walreceiver</code></td><td>Debug standby replication</td></tr><tr><td><code>backend</code></td><td>Application query logging</td></tr><tr><td><code>startup</code></td><td>Recovery and startup diagnostics</td></tr><tr><td><code>bgwriter</code></td><td>Background writer behavior</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h3 id="practical-example" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Practical Example</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#practical-example" aria-label="Link to Practical Example"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>To debug why autovacuum is running aggressively without adding noise from all other processes:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="text"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span>log_min_messages = &#x27;warning, autovacuum:debug2&#x27;</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-[min(1rem,calc(50%-.8175rem))]" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<p>This produces detailed autovacuum debug output (table selection, threshold calculations, page scanning) while keeping all other processes at warning level.</p>
<p>You can change this at runtime without a restart:</p>
<figure class="code-block group/code-block relative flex flex-col [&amp;_pre]:min-w-full rounded-none border border-gray-new-80 dark:border-gray-new-20 [&amp;&gt;pre]:my-0 [&amp;&gt;pre]:rounded-none [&amp;&gt;pre]:bg-white! [&amp;&gt;pre]:py-4 [&amp;&gt;pre]:dark:bg-black-pure!" data-has-filename="false" data-line-numbers="false"><pre class="shiki css-variables" style="background-color:var(--shiki-background);color:var(--shiki-foreground)" tabindex="0" data-language="sql"><code class="grid"><span class="line" data-line="1"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">ALTER</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SYSTEM</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)"> SET</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> log_min_messages </span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">=</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-string-expression)"> &#x27;warning, autovacuum:debug1&#x27;</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)">;</span></span>
<span class="line" data-line="2"><span style="color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)">SELECT</span><span style="color:var(--shiki-foreground)"> pg_reload_conf();</span></span></code></pre><button class="invisible absolute right-4 border border-gray-new-80 bg-white p-1.5 text-gray-new-40 opacity-0 transition-[background-color,opacity,visibility] duration-200 group-hover/code-block:visible group-hover/code-block:opacity-100 hover:bg-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:bg-black-pure dark:text-gray-new-60 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8 lg:visible lg:opacity-100 top-4" type="button" aria-label="Copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-current"><rect width="8.995" height="9.002" x="5.939" y="5.935" stroke="currentColor" rx="1"></rect><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M2.434.935a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5 1.5v7.001a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.5 1.5h1.499a.5.5 0 0 0 0-1h-1.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5V2.435a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h6.995a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v1.5a.5.5 0 1 0 1 0v-1.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0-1.5-1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></button></figure>
<h2 id="psql-prompt-improvements" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>psql Prompt Improvements</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#psql-prompt-improvements" aria-label="Link to psql Prompt Improvements"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>PostgreSQL 19 adds two new prompt escape sequences:</p>
<h3 id="percenti-primarystandby-status" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>%i: Primary/Standby Status</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#percenti-primarystandby-status" aria-label="Link to %i: Primary/Standby Status"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
<p>Shows whether the connected server is a primary or standby:</p>
